# Origin of the API for production (Vercel).
# LOCAL DEV: leave this blank so Vite proxies /api and /ws to http://127.0.0.1:8000
# (required if other laptops open http://<your-lan-ip>:5173).
# Do NOT set http://localhost:8000 if teammates open the Network URL — their browser
# would call their own machine, and chat would look "broken".
VITE_API_URL=
